{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t在北京，外交部在例行記者會回應菲律賓表示正與台灣尋求更深合作，保護海纜。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n發言人毛寧表示，在台灣問題上沒有灰色地帶，菲方應當以實際行動恪守一個中國原則，中國台灣地區展開對外交往應當嚴格按照一個中國原則處理。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：鄭皓璟\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T10:15:03.017706+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T09:52:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T20:58:21.927546+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T10:10:27.841158+00:00","content_hash":"0309ed7db0e1fcbbf559637be0a6987e825e4f872b64f53759b5cb31ca32a407","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}